.TH NASA 1.SH NAMEnasa \- turn satellite elements into orbit's input.SH SYNOPSIS\fBnasa\fR.SH DESCRIPTION\fBnasa\fRreads\fBnasa.dat\fRin the current directory -- NORAD two-line element sets, a name linefollowed by line 1 and line 2 for each satellite -- and writes\fBkepler.dat\fR,\fRthe Keplerian elements\fBorbit\fRreads.  The element lines are read by column, so keep them exactly aspublished.  Element sets are published for every satellite; supply acurrent one..SH FILES.TP 12\fBnasa.dat\fRthe input..TP 12\fBkepler.dat\fRthe output..SH NOTESNeeds Microware's\fBcio\fR.\fR.SH SEE ALSOorbit